    "content_html": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-1226\" src=\"https://cfi.co/awards/wp-content/uploads/2014/05/s.jpg\" alt=\"s\" width=\"208\" height=\"53\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">The CFI.co Judging Panel considers Souqalmal.com to be a highly credible and accomplished site noting that, ‘this award winner clearly has integrity and is doing a superb job. Souqalmal.com is a young company that has grown phenomenally since its establishment two years ago and its site is available in the English language as well as Arabic.’</p>",
